{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110825","id":3445769133,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7NYkOt","number":110825,"title":"Static variables are strange.","user":{"login":"iMytDev","id":175502424,"node_id":"U_kgDOCnX0WA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/175502424?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev","html_url":"https://github.com/iMytDev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMytDev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2025-09-23T15:31:11Z","updated_at":"2025-09-23T15:36:01Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.5\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt's not something that really affects it, but I thought it would be good to inform you about it.\n\nWhen I create two static variables, and one of them references the other, if that reference variable isn't set, its reference is null, but if only the type is set, it is referenced correctly.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n> Create 2 statics values\n\n> Reference one static to another static with his value defined.\n\n> Change his property, or value, of the static variable and print it.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust with his type set, without setting the value:\n```gdscript\nstatic var dics = [dics2]\nstatic var dics2: Dictionary\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tdics2['a'] = null\n\tprint(dics) #prints [{'a': null}]\n```\n\n\nIf the value is set:\n```gdscript\nstatic var dics = [dics2]\nstatic var dics2: Dictionary = { } #or also {'a': null}\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tdics2['a'] = null\n\tprint(dics) #prints [{ }]\n```\n\nWithout value type set:\n```gdscript\nstatic var dics = [dics2]\nstatic var dics2 = {}\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tdics2['a'] = null\n\tprint(dics) #prints [<null>]\n```\n\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110825/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}